    "text": "Goa CM Pramod Sawant Shares His Vision For The State | Reveals His Favourite Beach And More | TBC\nGoa Chief Minister Pramod Sawant opens up about his vision for the future of Goa in this exclusive interview. From boosting tourism and sustainable development to enhancing infrastructure, Sawant shares his plans to make Goa a top destination while preserving its unique culture and environment. He also reveals his favorite beach spot in Goa, giving fans a glimpse into his personal side.People did not think of Goa beyond 'Sun, Sand and Sea'. We added 'Spirituality' into it. People are now driven towards temple tourism\": From cleanliness drive, boosting infrastructure, promoting wellness tourism to push for self-reliance, Chief Minister Pramod Sawant shares his vision for Goa. n18oc_IndiaNews18 Mobile App - https://onelink.to/desc-youtube\nAdvertisement\nGet",
